<title>PORTUGAL: Price in Totta privatisation 2,630 esc.</title>
<headline>Price in Totta privatisation 2,630 esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price fixed in the privatisation of a 13.22 percent stake in Portuguese bank Banco Totta e Acores is 2,630 escudos per share, the Lisbon bourse said.  </p>
<p>Lisbon bourse held a special session on Tuesday to announce the results of the sale of 1.6 million Totta shares in a public offer to sell (OPV) and more than 6.3 million shares in a direct domestic and international sale.</p>
<p>The new Totta shares will be admitted to Lisbon bourse on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Totta shares closed at 2,705 escudos on Lisbon bourse on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
